notes.content:
Captains!

An update containing multiple fixes has been uploaded to the game server. Here's a list of those:

[list]
[*] For a wanted captain, the time of aggression has been increased 10 times;
[*] Fixes an issue that caused incorrect deterioration in settlements;
[*] Settlements no longer deteriorate faster when under Inside Out's protection;
[*] Improved unloading from weaponry, engine and other slots;
[*] Setlement manager can now also be used in a "beginner's settlement";
[*] Fixed an issue with installing upgrades in a remote settlement;
[*] Fixed an issue with selling defence crystals to Buyer;
[*] Increased cooldown of bomb racks;
[*] Removed the message indicating that a border of a region has been crossed;
[*] Tweaked synchronization of building repair time;
[*] Improved client's stability.
[/list]

~LUCKCATCHERS2 Team
